Comment:
 loftail links no code from log4cplus, whose logs it reads; it has no
 compile-time relationship to that library at all.
 .
 It does link Qt 6 (LGPL-3.0-or-later), and optionally libssh2
 (BSD-3-Clause), libarchive (BSD-2-Clause) and QtKeychain
 (BSD-3-Clause). Those are dependencies of this package, not part of
 its source, so their terms are stated by their own packages; all four
 are compatible with distributing the combined work under the GPL.
